# Recipe of the Play 6 updater (decision 2026-11-10 Q1, one updater 2026-11-13), read by
# tools/devices/assemble_app.py: the shared updater (apps/core/lumen-updater, with lumen-stats) and the Play 6 layer
# apps/Play6Updater: its UpdateTarget (Target.java: the play6 channel, the recovery install on /cache) and its
# AndroidManifest.xml (system uid and RECOVERY for /cache and the BCB, as AOSP's own non-A/B updaters run).
# tools/play6/build_play6.sh and tools/arch/baseline.sh build the assembled tree.
app       Play6Updater
module    lumen-stats
# the Lumen icon set (apps/core/lumen-icons, its R class named in the top layer R_EXTRA_PACKAGES)
module    lumen-icons
# the XGIMI set update_engine copies, checked before an install (apps/core/lumen-fwcopy, one with the installer)
module    lumen-fwcopy
# the QR codes of the update screen (apps/core/lumen-qr)
module    lumen-qr
# the parallel resumable download of the OTA zip, one with Lumen Installer (apps/core/lumen-download)
module    lumen-download
module    lumen-updater
top       apps/Play6Updater
skip      build/ tools/ *.apk CHANGES*.md README*.md .DS_Store
identical error
